<title>JAPAN: Daihatsu Diesel Mfg - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daihatsu Diesel Mfg - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.12		vs	   15.64</p>
<p> Operating	  171 million	 vs	  185 million</p>
<p> Current	     62 million	 vs	  114 million</p>
<p> Net		   16 million	 vs	   13 million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.59 yen	  vs	    0.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares		28 million	 vs	   28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Daihatsu Diesel Mfg Co Ltd is a manufacturer of marine diesel engines.</p>
</text>
